{"words": [{"text": "فَإِنْ", "translation": "Then if"}, {"text": "عُثِرَ", "translation": "it is discovered"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰٓ", "translation": "(on)"}, {"text": "أَنَّهُمَا", "translation": "that the two"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَحَقَّآ", "translation": "(were) guilty"}, {"text": "إِثْمًۭا", "translation": "(of) sin"}, {"text": "فَـَٔاخَرَانِ", "translation": "then (let) two others"}, {"text": "يَقُومَانِ", "translation": "stand"}, {"text": "مَقَامَهُمَا", "translation": "(in) their place"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَحَقَّ", "translation": "have a lawful right"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "translation": "over them "}, {"text": "ٱلْأَوْلَيَـٰنِ", "translation": "the former two "}, {"text": "فَيُقْسِمَانِ", "translation": "and let them both swear"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "by Allah"}, {"text": "لَشَهَـٰدَتُنَآ", "translation": "Surely our testimony"}, {"text": "أَحَقُّ", "translation": "(is) truer"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "than"}, {"text": "شَهَـٰدَتِهِمَا", "translation": "testimony of the other two"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "ٱعْتَدَيْنَآ", "translation": "we have transgressed"}, {"text": "إِنَّآ", "translation": "Indeed, we"}, {"text": "إِذًۭا", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "لَّمِنَ", "translation": "(will be) of"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "But if it is found that those two were guilty of sin [i.e., perjury], let two others stand in their place [who are] foremost [in claim] from those who have a lawful right. And let them swear by Allāh, \"Our testimony is truer than their testimony, and we have not transgressed. Indeed, we would then be of the wrongdoers.\""}